        <div class="card p-5 space-y-2">
          <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-rose-500/10 text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M20 12v10H4V12M2 7h20v5H2zM12 22V7M12 7H7.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5C11 2 12 7 12 7zm0 0h4.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 0-5C13 2 12 7 12 7z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-primary-light dark:text-primary-dark">Personalized Gifts & Cards</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-secondary-light dark:text-secondary-dark leading-relaxed">
            Uncover meaningful monthly birthstones, birth flowers, and famous historical birthday twins to write deeply touching personalized birthday messages.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- DID YOU KNOW? FACT STRIP -->
    <div class="card p-5 sm:p-6 border-accent/20 bg-accent/5 space-y-3" aria-labelledby="trivia-strip-heading">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-18 0 9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/>
        </svg>
        <h2 id="trivia-strip-heading" class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent">
          Did You Know? Fascinating Birthday & Calendar Trivia
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-1">
        <div class="space-y-1">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-primary-light dark:text-primary-dark flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-accent shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
              <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/>
              <path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/>
            </svg>
            The Birthday Paradox
          </span>
          <p class="text-xs text-secondary-light dark:text-secondary-dark leading-relaxed">
            In a group of only 23 people, there is a 50.7% mathematical probability that at least two people share an exact birthday. In a room of 75 people, the odds rise to 99.9%.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-1">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-primary-light dark:text-primary-dark flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-accent shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <polygon points="12 2 2 8.5 12 15 22 8.5 12 2"/>
              <polygon points="2 15.5 12 22 22 15.5 12 9 2 15.5"/>
            </svg>
            Origin of Birthstones
          </span>
          <p class="text-xs text-secondary-light dark:text-secondary-dark leading-relaxed">
            The 12 monthly birthstones trace back to the ceremonial breastplate of Aaron in the Book of Exodus, but were officially formalized for modern jewelry in 1912.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-1">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-primary-light dark:text-primary-dark flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-accent shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/>
              <line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"/>
              <line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"/>
              <line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"/>
            </svg>
            Most Common Birthdays
          </span>
          <p class="text-xs text-secondary-light dark:text-secondary-dark leading-relaxed">
            Globally, mid-September (specifically September 9 and September 19) records the highest frequency of birthdays, while Tuesdays and Thursdays see the most hospital births.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Methodology & Trivia Data Sources (E-E-A-T) -->
    <div class="card p-5 border-border-light dark:border-border-dark space-y-2 bg-bg-light/50 dark:bg-bg-dark/50">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary-light dark:text-primary-dark flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span>📐</span>
          <span>Methodology & Historical Verification</span>
        </h3>
        <span class="text-[11px] text-secondary-light dark:text-secondary-dark">
          Last updated: {lastUpdatedDate}
        </span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-secondary-light dark:text-secondary-dark leading-relaxed">
        Birthdays, generational cohorts, and famous historical figures are verified against authoritative encyclopedic archives and Pew Research demographic frameworks. All calculations execute client-side with zero network tracking.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 6. COMMON QUESTIONS & FAQ -->
  <section class="mt-14 space-y-4" id="faq-section">
    <div class="text-center sm:text-left space-y-1">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-primary-light dark:text-primary-dark">
        Frequently Asked Questions
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-secondary-light dark:text-secondary-dark">
        Everything you need to know about calculating birth weekdays, zodiac signs, and life milestones.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Quick Navigation Chips -->
    <div class="card p-4 space-y-2.5 bg-surface-light dark:bg-surface-dark border border-border-light dark:border-border-dark">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary-light dark:text-secondary-dark">
          Quick Jump
        </span>
        <span class="text-xs text-accent font-medium">{faqs.length} Answers</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
        {faqs.map((faq, idx) => (
          <a
            href={`#faq-item-${idx + 1}`}
            class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-bg-light dark:bg-bg-dark border border-border-light dark:border-border-dark text-secondary-light dark:text-secondary-dark hover:text-accent hover:border-accent transition-colors"
          >
            {faq.question}
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- FAQ Accordion Component -->
    <Faq items={faqs} />
  </section>

  <!-- 7. RELATED TOOLS SECTION -->
  <section class="mt-14 pt-10 border-t border-border-light dark:border-border-dark space-y-4">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
      <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-primary-light dark:text-primary-dark">
        Related Free Tools
      </h2>
      <a href="/" class="text-xs font-semibold text-accent hover:underline">
        View all tools &rarr;
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      {relatedTools.map((tool) => (
        <ToolCard
          title={tool.name}
          description={tool.desc}
          href={tool.href}
          anchor={tool.anchor}
          icon={tool.href.includes('age') ? 'calendar' : tool.href.includes('countdown') ? 'clock' : 'book'}
        />
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Toast notification handled globally via src/components/Toast.astro and src/scripts/toast.js -->
</Base>

<script>
  import { validateDate, getBirthdayFacts } from '../scripts/birthday-facts.js';
  import {
    saveHistory,
    saveLastState,
    getLastState,
    initHistoryCard,
  } from '../scripts/history.js';
  import { showToast } from '../scripts/toast.js';

  let currentFacts = null;

  function initBirthdayFacts() {
    const monthSelect = document.getElementById('dob-month');
    const daySelect = document.getElementById('dob-day');
    const yearSelect = document.getElementById('dob-year');
    const nativeDateInput = document.getElementById('native-dob-date');
    const revealBtn = document.getElementById('reveal-facts-btn');
    const dobCard = document.getElementById('dob-tool');
    const errorContainer = document.getElementById('facts-date-error');
    const errorText = document.getElementById('facts-date-error-text');
    const resultsContainer = document.getElementById('facts-results-container');
    const downloadBtn = document.getElementById('download-card-btn');
    const shareBtn = document.getElementById('share-facts-btn');
    const resetBtn = document.getElementById('reset-facts-btn');

    if (!monthSelect || !daySelect || !yearSelect || !revealBtn) return;

    // Sync native calendar picker
    if (nativeDateInput) {
      nativeDateInput.addEventListener('change', () => {
        if (!nativeDateInput.value) return;
        const [y, m, d] = nativeDateInput.value.split('-').map(Number);
        if (y && m && d) {
          yearSelect.value = String(y);
          monthSelect.value = String(m);
          daySelect.value = String(d);
          clearError();
        }
      });
    }

    function syncNative() {
      if (!nativeDateInput) return;
      const y = yearSelect.value;
      const m = monthSelect.value.padStart(2, '0');
      const d = daySelect.value.padStart(2, '0');
      if (y && m && d) {
        nativeDateInput.value = `${y}-${m}-${d}`;
      }
    }

    [monthSelect, daySelect, yearSelect].forEach((el) => {
      el.addEventListener('change', () => {
        clearError();
        syncNative();
      });
    });

    function showError(msg) {
      if (!errorContainer || !errorText) return;
      errorText.textContent = msg;
      errorContainer.classList.remove('hidden');

      // Subtle card shake on invalid submit
      if (dobCard) {
        dobCard.classList.remove('animate-card-shake');
        void dobCard.offsetWidth; // force reflow
        dobCard.classList.add('animate-card-shake');
        setTimeout(() => dobCard.classList.remove('animate-card-shake'), 400);
      }
    }

    function clearError() {
      if (errorContainer) errorContainer.classList.add('hidden');
    }

    // Reveal Facts Handler
    function handleReveal() {
      clearError();

      const year = parseInt(yearSelect.value, 10);
      const month = parseInt(monthSelect.value, 10);
      const day = parseInt(daySelect.value, 10);

      const validation = validateDate(year, month, day);
      if (!validation.valid) {
        showError(validation.error || 'Please enter a valid calendar date.');
        return;
      }

      const facts = getBirthdayFacts(year, month, day);
      currentFacts = facts;

      // Save to recent activity history and last state
      const monthNames = ['', 'January', 'February', 'March', 'April', 'May', 'June', 'July', 'August', 'September', 'October', 'November', 'December'];
      const birthdayTitle = `Birthday: ${day} ${monthNames[month] || ''} ${year}`;
      saveHistory('facts', {
        t: birthdayTitle,
        d: new Date().toISOString(),
        x: { year, month, day },
      });
      saveLastState('facts', { year, month, day });

      // 1. Populate Shareable Card
      const cardWeekday = document.getElementById('card-weekday');
      const cardFormattedDate = document.getElementById('card-formatted-date');
      const cardGenBadge = document.getElementById('card-generation-badge');
      const cardZodiacSymbol = document.getElementById('card-zodiac-symbol');
      const cardZodiacName = document.getElementById('card-zodiac-name');
      const cardZodiacElement = document.getElementById('card-zodiac-element');
      const cardZodiacTraits = document.getElementById('card-zodiac-traits');
      const cardStoneName = document.getElementById('card-stone-name');
      const cardStoneMeaning = document.getElementById('card-stone-meaning');
      const cardFlowerName = document.getElementById('card-flower-name');
      const cardFlowerMeaning = document.getElementById('card-flower-meaning');
      const cardDaysLived = document.getElementById('card-days-lived');

      if (cardWeekday) cardWeekday.textContent = facts.weekday;
      if (cardFormattedDate) cardFormattedDate.textContent = facts.formattedDate;
      if (cardGenBadge) cardGenBadge.textContent = facts.generation.shortName || facts.generation.name;

      if (cardZodiacSymbol) cardZodiacSymbol.textContent = facts.zodiac.symbol;
      if (cardZodiacName) cardZodiacName.textContent = facts.zodiac.name;
      if (cardZodiacElement) cardZodiacElement.textContent = facts.zodiac.element;

      if (cardZodiacTraits) {
        cardZodiacTraits.innerHTML = facts.zodiac.traits
          .map(
            (t) =>
              `<span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-medium bg-accent/10 text-accent border border-accent/20">${t}</span>`
          )
          .join('');
      }

      if (cardStoneName) cardStoneName.textContent = facts.birthstone.name;
      if (cardStoneMeaning) cardStoneMeaning.textContent = facts.birthstone.meaning;

      if (cardFlowerName) cardFlowerName.textContent = facts.birthFlower.name;
      if (cardFlowerMeaning) cardFlowerMeaning.textContent = facts.birthFlower.meaning;

      if (cardDaysLived) cardDaysLived.textContent = `${facts.milestones.daysLived.toLocaleString()} days`;

      // 2. Populate Famous People Section (1 -> 2 -> 3 columns, fixed height + truncation, +N more handling)
      const famousDateHeading = document.getElementById('famous-date-heading');
      const famousGrid = document.getElementById('famous-grid');
      const leapNotice = document.getElementById('leap-day-notice');

      if (famousDateHeading) famousDateHeading.textContent = facts.shortDate;

      if (leapNotice) {
        if (facts.famous.leapDayNote) {
          leapNotice.textContent = facts.famous.leapDayNote;
          leapNotice.classList.remove('hidden');
        } else {
          leapNotice.classList.add('hidden');
        }
      }

      if (famousGrid) {
        const people = facts.famous.people || [];
        if (people.length > 0) {
          const maxVisible = 6;
          const displayPeople = people.length > maxVisible ? people.slice(0, maxVisible - 1) : people;
          const extraCount = people.length - displayPeople.length;

          let html = displayPeople
            .map(
              (p) => `
            <div class="h-[82px] card p-3 flex flex-col justify-center bg-surface-light dark:bg-surface-dark border border-border-light dark:border-border-dark">
              <div class="font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm text-primary-light dark:text-primary-dark flex items-center gap-1.5 min-w-0">
                <span class="text-accent shrink-0">★</span>
                <span class="truncate">${p.name}</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-secondary-light dark:text-secondary-dark line-clamp-2 leading-tight mt-0.5">
                ${p.known}
              </p>
            </div>
          `
            )
            .join('');

          if (extraCount > 0) {
            html += `
            <div class="h-[82px] card p-3 flex flex-col items-center justify-center bg-accent/5 border border-accent/25 text-center">
              <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-accent">+${extraCount} more</span>
              <span class="text-[11px] text-secondary-light dark:text-secondary-dark">historical figures born on this day</span>
            </div>
          `;
          }

          famousGrid.innerHTML = html;
        } else {
          famousGrid.innerHTML = `
            <div class="col-span-full card p-5 text-center text-xs sm:text-sm text-secondary-light dark:text-secondary-dark">
              No celebrity records in our offline archive for ${facts.shortDate}. You share your special day with millions of everyday pioneers worldwide!
            </div>
          `;
        }
      }

      // 3. Populate Facts Details Grid (Zodiac, Birthstone, Flower, Generation)
      const detailZodiacSymbol = document.getElementById('detail-zodiac-symbol');
      const detailZodiacElement = document.getElementById('detail-zodiac-element');
      const detailZodiacName = document.getElementById('detail-zodiac-name');
      const detailZodiacMeaning = document.getElementById('detail-zodiac-meaning');

      const detailStoneName = document.getElementById('detail-stone-name');
      const detailStoneMeaning = document.getElementById('detail-stone-meaning');

      const detailFlowerName = document.getElementById('detail-flower-name');
      const detailFlowerMeaning = document.getElementById('detail-flower-meaning');

      const detailGenYears = document.getElementById('detail-generation-years');
      const detailGenName = document.getElementById('detail-generation-name');
      const detailGenMeaning = document.getElementById('detail-generation-meaning');

      if (detailZodiacSymbol) detailZodiacSymbol.textContent = facts.zodiac.symbol;
      if (detailZodiacElement) detailZodiacElement.textContent = facts.zodiac.element;
      if (detailZodiacName) detailZodiacName.textContent = facts.zodiac.name;
      if (detailZodiacMeaning) detailZodiacMeaning.textContent = `${facts.zodiac.traits.join(', ')} temperament.`;

      if (detailStoneName) detailStoneName.textContent = facts.birthstone.name;
      if (detailStoneMeaning) detailStoneMeaning.textContent = facts.birthstone.meaning;

      if (detailFlowerName) detailFlowerName.textContent = facts.birthFlower.name;
      if (detailFlowerMeaning) detailFlowerMeaning.textContent = facts.birthFlower.meaning;

      if (detailGenYears) detailGenYears.textContent = `${facts.generation.startYear}–${facts.generation.endYear}`;
      if (detailGenName) detailGenName.textContent = facts.generation.name;
      if (detailGenMeaning) detailGenMeaning.textContent = facts.generation.description;

      // Populate Life Path Number
      const lifePathNum = document.getElementById('result-lifepath-num');
      const lifePathTitle = document.getElementById('result-lifepath-title');
      const lifePathTraits = document.getElementById('result-lifepath-traits');
      const lifePathSummary = document.getElementById('result-lifepath-summary');

      if (lifePathNum) lifePathNum.textContent = String(facts.lifePath.number);
      if (lifePathTitle) lifePathTitle.textContent = `${facts.lifePath.number} — ${facts.lifePath.title}`;
      if (lifePathTraits) lifePathTraits.textContent = `Core Traits: ${facts.lifePath.traits}`;
      if (lifePathSummary) lifePathSummary.textContent = facts.lifePath.summary;

      // 4. Populate Milestones
      const milestoneDays = document.getElementById('milestone-days-count');
      const milestone10kBadge = document.getElementById('milestone-10k-badge');
      const milestone10kDate = document.getElementById('milestone-10k-date');
      const milestone10kStatus = document.getElementById('milestone-10k-status');

      const milestoneNextLabel = document.getElementById('milestone-next-label');
      const milestoneNextDate = document.getElementById('milestone-next-date');
      const milestoneNextCountdown = document.getElementById('milestone-next-countdown');

      if (milestoneDays) milestoneDays.textContent = `${facts.milestones.daysLived.toLocaleString()} days`;

      if (milestone10kDate) milestone10kDate.textContent = facts.milestones.day10k.date;
      if (milestone10kBadge && milestone10kStatus) {
        if (facts.milestones.day10k.isPassed) {
          milestone10kBadge.textContent = 'Celebrated';
          milestone10kBadge.className = 'text-[11px] px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full font-semibold bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400';
          milestone10kStatus.textContent = `Reached on ${facts.milestones.day10k.date}. You have already surpassed this landmark!`;
        } else {
          milestone10kBadge.textContent = 'Upcoming';
          milestone10kBadge.className = 'text-[11px] px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full font-semibold bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400';
          milestone10kStatus.textContent = `Arrives on ${facts.milestones.day10k.date} (in ${facts.milestones.day10k.daysUntil.toLocaleString()} days).`;
        }
      }

      if (milestoneNextLabel) milestoneNextLabel.textContent = `${facts.milestones.nextMilestone.milestone.toLocaleString()}th Day Landmark`;
      if (milestoneNextDate) milestoneNextDate.textContent = facts.milestones.nextMilestone.date;
      if (milestoneNextCountdown) milestoneNextCountdown.textContent = `Arriving in ${facts.milestones.nextMilestone.daysUntil.toLocaleString()} days.`;

      // 5. Reveal Results with Staggered Fade-Up (50ms stagger) & Scroll
      if (resultsContainer) {
        resultsContainer.classList.remove('hidden');

        // Staggered reveal of each child section
        const animSections = resultsContainer.querySelectorAll('.result-section-anim');
        animSections.forEach((sec, idx) => {
          sec.classList.remove('animate-fade-slide-up');
          void sec.offsetWidth; // force reflow
          sec.style.animationDelay = `${idx * 50}ms`;
          sec.classList.add('animate-fade-slide-up');
        });

        // Smooth scroll to results with sticky header offset
        const headerOffset = 80;
        const rect = resultsContainer.getBoundingClientRect();
        const targetScrollY = rect.top + window.pageYOffset - headerOffset;
        const prefersReduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;

        window.scrollTo({
          top: Math.max(0, targetScrollY),
          behavior: prefersReduced ? 'auto' : 'smooth',
        });
      }

      // Confetti burst on reveal (respecting reduced motion & non-intrusive)
      const prefersReducedMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      if (typeof window.confetti === 'function' && !prefersReducedMotion) {
        window.confetti({
          particleCount: 70,
          spread: 60,
          origin: { y: 0.6 },
          disableForReducedMotion: true,
        });
      }
    }

    revealBtn.addEventListener('click', handleReveal);

    // Save Card as Image via html-to-image
    if (downloadBtn) {
      downloadBtn.addEventListener('click', async () => {
        const cardElement = document.getElementById('shareable-card');
        if (!cardElement || !window.htmlToImage) {
          showToast('Image generator is initializing. Please try again.');
          return;
        }

        try {
          downloadBtn.setAttribute('disabled', 'true');
          showToast('Rendering high-res celebration card...');

          const dataUrl = await window.htmlToImage.toPng(cardElement, {
            quality: 1,
            pixelRatio: 2,
            cacheBust: true,
          });

          const link = document.createElement('a');
          link.download = `toolnest-birthday-card-${yearSelect.value}-${monthSelect.value}-${daySelect.value}.png`;
          link.href = dataUrl;
          link.click();

          showToast('Card saved to your device!');
        } catch (error) {
          console.error('Image capture error:', error);
          showToast('Unable to export image. Try taking a screenshot!');
        } finally {
          downloadBtn.removeAttribute('disabled');
        }
      });
    }

    // Share Facts Handler
    if (shareBtn) {
      shareBtn.addEventListener('click', async () => {
        if (!currentFacts) return;
        const f = currentFacts;
        const shareText = [
          `🎉 My Birthday Facts via ToolNest:`,
          `Born on a ${f.weekday} (${f.formattedDate})`,
          `Zodiac: ${f.zodiac.symbol} ${f.zodiac.name} (${f.zodiac.element})`,
          `Birthstone: ${f.birthstone.name} • Flower: ${f.birthFlower.name}`,
          `Generation: ${f.generation.name}`,
          `Alive for: ${f.milestones.daysLived.toLocaleString()} days`,
          `Discover yours: ${window.location.href}`,
        ].join('\n');

        if (navigator.share) {
          try {
            await navigator.share({
              title: `My Birthday Facts on ToolNest`,
              text: shareText,
              url: window.location.href,
            });
          } catch (err) {
            // Cancelled
          }
        } else {
          try {
            await navigator.clipboard.writeText(shareText);
            showToast('Summary copied to clipboard!');
          } catch (e) {
            showToast('Unable to share on this browser.');
          }
        }
      });
    }

    // Reset Form Handler
    if (resetBtn) {
      resetBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        if (resultsContainer) resultsContainer.classList.add('hidden');
        window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: 'smooth' });
        daySelect.focus();
      });
    }

    // Restore from history
    function restoreFacts(data) {
      if (!data || !data.year) return;
      yearSelect.value = String(data.year);
      monthSelect.value = String(data.month);
      daySelect.value = String(data.day);
      syncNative();
      handleReveal();
    }

    // Prefill from last state if available ("welcome back" effect)
    const last = getLastState('facts');
    if (last && last.year) {
      yearSelect.value = String(last.year);
      monthSelect.value = String(last.month);
      daySelect.value = String(last.day);
      syncNative();
    }

    initHistoryCard({ toolId: 'facts', onRestore: restoreFacts });
  }

  initBirthdayFacts();
  document.addEventListener('astro:after-swap', initBirthdayFacts);
</script>
